            "review_title": "Review at Bát Eatery",
            "review_text": "Dana Hlaine Htet\nYangon (Rangoon), Myanmar418 contributions\n1\nGreat Food\nAug 2023 • Friends\nWe came across this new establishment and made an order for lunch over the phone. The owner was very responsive and polite. My colleagues and I enjoyed the food and the homemade tea very much. The food came quickly as it's near our office (Duy Tân St.). Also, it came with a little note from the owner. We enjoyed the food and the hospitality. Will definitely order again. Keep up your good work Bát Eatery.\nRead more\nWritten September 5, 2023",
